    "thread-1792527554176-2-contextual-insight-cards-quick-suggestio": {
      "id": "thread-1792527554176-2-contextual-insight-cards-quick-suggestio",
      "title": "Contextual Insight Cards: Quick Suggestions Based on Patterns",
      "description": "Dashboards will become personalized life coaches, showing suggestions like 'Hey, you usually get stuck here, want to address it first?' using behavioral data, preferences, and mood indicators. Mission Control could add a small insight banner on the Home card (\"You completed 4 S-ranks this week—5 in a row unlocks a new badge!\" or \"Most active time: 6–8pm\"). This requires minimal backend work—just flagging patterns in the existing data—but transforms the dashboard from passive tracker to active coach.",
      "source_title": "10 UI Trends to Watch Out for in 2026",
      "source_url": "https://medium.com/@ryan.almeida86/10-ui-trends-to-watch-out-for-in-2026-0905e527a582",
      "mockup_html": "<style>*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}.mockup{background:#0a1929;color:#dfeeff;font-family:VT323,monospace;padding:40px;min-height:300px}.insight-card{background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(30,58,95,0.8),rgba(18,35,60,0.8));border:2px inset #ff8a63;border-radius:1px;padding:16px;margin-bottom:16px;position:relative;overflow:hidden}.insight-card::before{content:'';position:absolute;top:0;left:-100%;width:100%;height:100%;background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,rgba(255,138,99,0.1),transparent);animation:shimmer 2s infinite}.insight-icon{font-size:18px;margin-bottom:8px}@keyframes shimmer{0%{left:-100%}100%{left:100%}}.insight-title{font-size:11px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;color:#ff8a63;margin-bottom:6px}.insight-text{font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;color:#dfeeff}.insight-progress{width:100%;height:6px;background:#12253c;margin-top:10px;border:1px solid rgba(255,138,99,0.2)}.insight-progress-fill{height:100%;background:#ff8a63;width:80%}</style><div class=\"mockup\"><div class=\"insight-card\"><div class=\"insight-icon\">⭐</div><div class=\"insight-title\">Close to Milestone!</div><div class=\"insight-text\">You've completed 4 S-ranks this week. One more gets you a new badge!</div><div class=\"insight-progress\"><div class=\"insight-progress-fill\"></div></div></div><div class=\"insight-card\"><div class=\"insight-icon\">🕐</div><div class=\"insight-title\">Your Peak Hours</div><div class=\"insight-text\">Most quests completed 6–8pm. Consider scheduling harder tasks then.</div></div></div>",
